# Dack Fayden's emblem needs a spell that "targets one or more permanents". Bot1 reaches the emblem on turn 7. Reanimate
# targets a creature card in Bot2's graveyard (not a permanent): the emblem's ability does not trigger, only the Reanimate
# is on the stack. On turn 8 Bot2 casts an Ornithopter and Bot1's Counterspell targets that spell (a spell is not a
# permanent): again nothing triggers.

